  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十九关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "text": "Nngh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "What's wrong with her...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "It's an acute symptom of Oripathy!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "But it's only been a week...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "There's also an acute form of Oripathy?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Franka, which type is yours?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "What, are you concerned about me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Amiya, if Franka passes away, I hope that Rhodes Island will cremate her.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Hey!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "That's mean, Liskarm!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "You're the one who's always talking about passing the infection on to me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Aha... Ahaha...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "The difference between the acute and chronic types is a rather complicated topic.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "However, Misha's condition is very dangerous.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "If we don't do anything, this condition will become life threatening very quickly.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "All we can do is give her some emergency treatment...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "But we must control Misha's symptoms as quickly as possible.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We have to make this clear to Lungmen. After this ends, we have to bring Misha with us back to Rhodes Island.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "This is part of our responsibility.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Um...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Is she... going to explode soon?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Oww! That hurt! Why'd you hit me...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Watch your mouth.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Ughh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "If I'm going to explode one day, I'll make sure to crawl up to you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "I'm sorry! Miss Franka, please forgive me for everything I've done!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Pfft...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Let's transfer her to a safe place first.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "By the way, we seem to have a situation behind us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "text": "What are you doing? ! Get out! !",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "We're all fellow Infected here, don't make us resort to violence! Get out of our way!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "text": "You've already destroyed our home, and now you're trying to get the L.G.D. here?! Forget it! !",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "text": "You little...! You ignorant fool, get out of the way! !",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "text": "Argh!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "text": "Now you've done it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "(Are we going to step in?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "(We seem to have finally lost them. But if we intervene now, we're going to be exposed.)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "(Is this going to get in the way of our mission? If so, how serious are the consequences going to be?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "(Of course this is going to interfere, but...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "(It won't be that serious, right?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Let's do it, then.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Rhodes Island's unequivocal mission to save the Infected, as long as the situation permits.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Mmhm, good.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "I knew following you was the right decision.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "What do you mean by that, Miss Franka?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Don't worry, don't worry! I was just complimenting you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "She probably thinks that she can get along well with you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "How do you know me so well?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Probably because you're so annoying?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Ugh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "It's time to teach these thugs a lesson.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Yes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Be careful of the enemies who can jump between buildings.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "In addition, make sure to protect Lungmen's Infected civilians!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "That's asking for a lot.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "--But, I'll handle it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "All right, let's go!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, make sure to lead me and Texas well!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
